	(gr_text "XM125 radar on B.Cu (U1): radiates down, out of the flat bottom. Keep the enclosure wall in front of U1 free of metal; wall thickness ~ n x lambda/2 in the plastic (PETG ~1.6 mm), gap U1 top to wall ~ n x 2.5 mm (Acconeer HW integration guideline 3.7)."
